+      Called on every path out of the loop body, including the ones where
+      this entity did not act. The callback is documented as running after
+      each iteration, but it used to sit past two `continue` statements, so
+      an entity that drew no turn passed through silently. A caller counting
+      invocations to follow progress therefore observed
+      `max_steps * activity_rate(entity)` rather than `max_steps`, and a
+      finished run looked truncated.
+      """
+      if checkpoint_callback is not None:
+        logging.debug(
